# BACK AT THE CAMP (docs/ROADMAP.md slice 3, step 8), through the real keys. He
# crosses at the narrows and steps off at the landing, and the raft stays where he
# left it. At the archive Otto shows him one of the war's orders; once that has
# settled the Covenant's warden says whose roads are sold. Once both have been
# felt, the goal is the old soldier back at the crew's camp, and the survey pins
# the narrows where he landed. Back across on the raft he left: Dace, told the
# order was his, is done with the crew; then Rook, told of Teague's roads.
#
#   TOUR_TIMEOUT=900 tools/tour.sh tours/back-at-camp.tour --seed=1 --hour=9 --weather=clear:0 --beats=marens_lead,reaper_named,reaper_down,built_halcyon,holdfast_hope,war_archive,covenant_speaker,june_named,june_knew,echo_kept,enclave_met --met=june --chose=rook.iron=paid --give=pick:1,kit_plate:1,raft:1,stew:1,bread:1 --holding=lean-to
#
# (June's leg is staged behind him: tours/june.tour plays it. So is the climb
# Solis's road up leads to (enclave_met): tours/across.tour plays it. A holding
# of his stands (`--holding`), as slice 2 has him build one: without it, the
# night's taking out of the Covenant puts the holding's beds ahead of every lead.
# `mark the_raft` is where he stepped off, the tour's own doing; everything else
# is a place a system names. Otto's replies: "How the war started.", then "Show
# me one." second; Solis's first is "How do you know where I came from?"; Dace's
# first at the war, once the order is known, is "The order was mine."; Rook's
# third is Teague's roads; Solis, asked or let go, says the road up.)
coast calm

# --- over: the raft in at the narrows, and across ------------------------------------------
at slot:the_crossing
wait 0.5
walkto at:slot:the_landing 20 till:launch_ready:raft
tap ride
await riding:raft 3
walkto at:slot:the_landing 240
wait 0.3
walkto at:slot:the_archive 20 till:step_off_ready
tap ride
await parked:raft 3
mark the_raft
wait 1.0
shot 01-the-raft-left-at-the-landing with parked:raft

# --- the archive's order -------------------------------------------------------------------
at cast:otto
await cast:otto 8
wait 0.6
press use
await talking 3
wait 0.4
press use
wait 0.4
tap move_down
wait 0.3
press use
await beat:tradecraft 3
wait 0.4
shot 02-the-order-reads-like-him with talking,beat:tradecraft
press use
wait 0.6

# --- settled: the warden's word on Teague ---------------------------------------------------
# The order lands about noon (the crossing is some 180 world minutes); the
# warden's reply waits until it has settled (StoryPacing.SETTLE, 240).
hour 17
wait 1.0
at cast:solis
await cast:solis 8
wait 0.6
press use
await talking 3
wait 0.4
press use
await beat:teague_sold 3
wait 0.4
shot 03-solis-says-whose-roads with talking,beat:teague_sold
press use
await beat:walker_told 3
wait 0.4
press use
wait 0.6

# --- felt, the next morning: the old soldier, and the narrows -------------------------------
# Eighteen hours past the boot's meal he is starving, and six berries (1.5 h each)
# cannot bring that under hungry; stew and bread (24 h) keep him fed past Rook.
hour 9 +1
wait 1.0
tap inventory
wait 0.5
choose stew
tap use
wait 1.2
choose bread
tap use
wait 1.2
tap inventory
wait 0.6
await goal:camp_back 5
await goal_shown 20
shot 04-the-goal-is-the-old-soldier with goal:camp_back,goal_shown
press map 0.2
await app:map 6
wait 0.6
shot 05-the-survey-pins-the-narrows with app:map,goal:camp_back
press map 0.2
await app:none 5

# --- back across on the raft he left -------------------------------------------------------
at mark:the_raft
wait 0.8
shot 06-the-raft-where-he-left-it with parked:raft,goal:camp_back
tap ride
await riding:raft 3
walkto at:slot:the_crossing 240
wait 0.3
walkto at:slot:the_camp 20 till:step_off_ready
tap ride
await parked:raft 3
wait 0.6

# --- the old soldier, told ------------------------------------------------------------------
at cast:dace
await cast:dace 8
wait 0.6
press use
await talking 3
wait 0.4
press use
await beat:crew_war 3
wait 0.4
press use
await beat:dace_left 3
wait 0.4
shot 07-the-order-was-mine with talking,beat:dace_left
press use
wait 1.5
shot 08-the-goal-is-rook with goal:rook_teague,goal_shown

# --- Rook, told of Teague's roads --------------------------------------------------------------
at cast:rook
await cast:rook 8
wait 0.6
press use
await talking 3
wait 0.4
tap move_down
wait 0.3
tap move_down
wait 0.3
press use
await beat:rook_told 3
wait 0.4
shot 09-rook-will-see-to-it with talking,beat:rook_told
press use
wait 0.6
